/*

given L, A, B, M
which (L,A,B) is an arith progression A, A+B..., A+(L-1)B
find concat(A A+B A+2B .. A+(L-1)B) % M

1. find out how many steps to next magnitude

2. speed up the concat in current magnitude using matrix power

